6:["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-14","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-fg","children":"What This Demonstrates"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-fg-muted leading-relaxed","children":"Shopify powers checkout for millions of merchants; its own storefront-adjacent homepage is the most-visited sales asset it owns. The engine scores it 7.1/B - solid overall, but the details reveal maintenance debt: the H1 reads \"Be the nextAI all-star\" (the missing space between \"next\" and \"AI\" is a line-break collapse that shipped to production), the title runs 66 characters (truncated in most SERPs at ~60), and the HTML payload is 411KB - 3.4x the 120KB heuristic for a marketing page. H1 and title share almost no keywords: the title sells \"commerce platform\", the H1 sells an \"AI all-star\" campaign line."}]]}]
